      "kind": "misconception",
      "conceptId": "math.opt.convex-set",
      "title": "MIDPOINT-SUFFICIENT",
      "content": "| MC-3 | MIDPOINT-SUFFICIENT | Student checks only the midpoint t=1/2 rather than all t∈[0,1]; concludes the star-shaped set is convex because all midpoints are inside | Type 3 — language contamination (\"middle\" collapses t to 1/2) |",
